## Round Cycle Design

5라운드 순환 구조. 각 라운드는 메커닉이 **단계별로 추가**된다 (R5 이후 R2로 루프).

```
Round 1 — Tutorial        Round 2 — Challenge       Round 3 — Ice
────────────────────      ─────────────────────     ─────────────────────
Levels 1–10               Levels 1–50               Levels 1–50
Undo 5, no timer          No undo, 60s timer        + Ice stops (❄)
Optional move limit       Move limit enforced       (challenge base 유지)
                          New seeds                 New seeds

Round 4 — Path            Round 5 — Master          → Cycle
────────────────────      ─────────────────────     ─────────────────────
Levels 1–50               Levels 1–50               R5 클리어 후
+ Required trail cells    45s timer                 Round 2로 회귀
(challenge base 유지)     Ice stops + path forcing  (튜토리얼 제외 루프)
New seeds                 New seeds
```

### Round config matrix (`getRoundConfig`)

| Round | Label | Levels | Undo | Timer | Move limit | Ice stops | Path forcing |
|-------|-------|--------|------|-------|------------|-----------|--------------|
| 1 | Tutorial | 10 | 5 | Off | Optional | — | — |
| 2 | Challenge | 50 | 0 | 60s | On | — | — |
| 3 | Ice | 50 | 0 | 60s | On | ✅ config | — |
| 4 | Path | 50 | 0 | 60s | On | — | ✅ config |
| 5 | Master | 50 | 0 | 45s | On | ✅ config | ✅ config |
| R5 → | R2 | 50 | … | … | … | … | … |

> Ice / Path 열: **config 완료** (Phase 2). **gameplay 연동**은 Phase 3·4.

### Completion flow

| Round 완료 | 모달 CTA |
|------------|----------|
| Round 1 | **Continue to Round 2** / Play Again (R1) / Main Menu |
| Round 2 | **Continue to Round 3** / Play Again / Main Menu |
| Round 3 | **Continue to Round 4** / Play Again / Main Menu |
| Round 4 | **Continue to Round 5** / Play Again / Main Menu |
| Round 5 | **Continue to Round 2** / Play Again (R5) / Main Menu |

- `advanceRound()`: R1→R2→R3→R4→R5→**R2**
- `restartGame()`: 항상 Round 1, fresh seeds
- `replayCurrentRound()`: 현재 라운드 재시작, fresh seeds

